OL,3,GNEWSAVillages launch their own survey
OL,4,Aon reservoir
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople living near a proposed new
OL,7,Freservoir are being asked to give their
OL,8,Fviews in an independent survey.
OL,10,FParish councils from eight villages
OL,11,Fhave teamed up to launch the four-week
OL,12,Fsurvey about Thames Water's planned
OL,13,FWhite Horse Reservoir, near Abingdon,
OL,14,Fin Oxfordshire.
OL,16,FThey say communities affected by the
OL,17,Fscheme need a stronger chance to give
OL,18,Fevidence about its local impact, from
OL,19,Ftraffic and flooding, to chalk streams
OL,20,Fand wildlife.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
